{"schema":1,"revision":86178817,"page":{"pageid":530530,"title":"澳洲動物相","displayTitle":"澳洲動物相","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"noteTA-2267882\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-local\"><div data-noteta-code=\"zh:澳大利亞;zh-hant:澳洲;zh-hans:澳洲;zh-cn:澳洲;zh-tw:澳洲;zh-hk:澳洲;zh-mo:澳洲;\"></div><div data-noteta-code=\"zh:澳大利亚;zh-hant:澳洲;zh-hans:澳洲;zh-cn:澳洲;zh-tw:澳洲;zh-hk:澳洲;zh-mo:澳洲;\"></div></div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kangur.rudy.drs.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Kangur.rudy.drs.jpg/250px-Kangur.rudy.drs.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"165\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Kangur.rudy.drs.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"330\" /></a><figcaption> <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B4%85%E8%A2%8B%E9%BC%A0\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"紅袋鼠\">紅袋鼠</a>是最大的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A2%8B%E9%BC%A0\" title=\"袋鼠\">袋鼠</a>，也是澳洲最具代表性的動物之一，出現在<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%9C%8B%E5%BE%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"澳洲國徽\">澳洲國徽</a>上。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"澳洲\">澳洲</a></b>的<b>動物相</b>包含了多種獨特的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"動物\">動物</a>。居住在這片<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"澳洲大陸\">大陸</a>上的動物中，有83%的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%BA%E4%B9%B3%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"哺乳類\">哺乳類</a>、89%的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%AC%E8%9F%B2%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"爬蟲類\">爬蟲類</a>、90%的<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AD%9A\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"魚\">魚</a>與<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%86%E8%9F%B2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"昆蟲\">昆蟲</a>，以及93%的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%A9%E6%A3%B2%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"兩棲類\">兩棲類</a>是澳洲的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%89%E7%A8%AE\" title=\"特有種\">特有種</a>。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Williams&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Williams-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"魚類\"><span id=\".E9.AD.9A.E9.A1.9E\"></span>魚類</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：魚類\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Maccullochella_peelii_peelii.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Maccullochella_peelii_peelii.jpg/330px-Maccullochella_peelii_peelii.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"260\" height=\"190\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/Maccullochella_peelii_peelii.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"613\" data-file-height=\"449\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A2%A8%E7%91%9E%E9%B1%88\" title=\"墨瑞鱈\">墨瑞鱈</a>是澳洲體型最大的淡水魚種。</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"註腳\"><span id=\".E8.A8.BB.E8.85.B3\"></span>註腳</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：註腳\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Williams-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Williams_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Williams, J. et al. 2001. <i>Biodiversity, Australia State of the Environment Report 2001</i> (Theme Report), CSIRO Publishing on behalf of the Department of the Environment and Heritage, Canberra. <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0643067493\" class=\"internal mw-magiclink-isbn\">ISBN 0-643-06749-3</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.deh.gov.au/soe/2001/biodiversity/pubs/biodiversity.pdf\">.pdf</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20051016015009/http://www.deh.gov.au/soe/2001/biodiversity/pubs/biodiversity.pdf\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%BE%B3%E6%B4%B2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.deh.gov.au/biodiversity/abrs/\">澳洲生物研究資源</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20090108192522/http://www.deh.gov.au/biodiversity/abrs/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20050707074547/http://www.ento.csiro.au/aicn/\">澳洲的昆蟲介紹</a></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.environment.gov.au/biodiversity/abrs/online-resources/fauna/afd/index.html\">澳洲動物目錄</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20160505200720/http://www.environment.gov.au/biodiversity/abrs/online-resources/fauna/afd/index.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.austmus.gov.au/\">澳洲自然史博物館</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20060301212208/http://www.austmus.gov.au/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070410043234/http://www.mov.vic.gov.au/crust/hermgall.html\">澳洲甲殼類動物圖片集</a></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"英語\">（英文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amonline.net.au/fossil_sites/index.htm\">澳洲的化石</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20060713191715/http://www.amonline.net.au/fossil_sites/index.htm\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"中文\">（繁體中文）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.zoo.gov.tw/exhibit/austra.shtml\">台北市立動物園澳洲動物區</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20090227162721/http://www.zoo.gov.tw/exhibit/austra.shtml\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r94154877\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-li{display:none}.mw-parser-output .hlis